td char="." align="char">80</td><td char="." align="char">3,75</td><td char="." align="char">1,48</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Control</td><td char="." align="char">80</td><td char="." align="char">4,69</td><td char="." align="char">1,10</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="3">VAS - Post Op 12. week</td><td align="left">ACBs</td><td char="." align="char">80</td><td char="." align="char">1,66</td><td char="." align="char">0,98</td><td char="." align="char" rowspan="3">11,2</td><td align="left" rowspan="3"><bold>0</bold>,<bold>004</bold></td><td align="left" rowspan="3"><p>1&#x02009;&#x0003c;&#x02009;3</p><p>2&#x02009;&#x0003c;&#x02009;3</p></td></tr><tr><td align="left">ACBa</td><td char="." align="char">80</td><td char="." align="char">1,54</td><td char="." align="char">0,81</td></tr><tr><td align="left">Control</td><td char="." align="char">80</td><td char="." align="char">1,98</td><td char="." align="char">0,95</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p>ACBs: Adductor canal block by surgeon; ACBa: Adductor canal block by anesthesiology</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap>
</p><p id="Par30">On the first three days, the ACBa group had the lowest opioid consumption and the lowest total opioid consumption (Table&#x000a0;<xref rid="Tab3" ref-type="table">3</xref>).</p><p id="Par54">
